OpenSolo wire contract from Decryptortuning/mavlink-solo commit 3887c3f7b491b41b02a6061dfd4a1f8f54162da7, message_definitions/v1.0. Only filenames/include references are namespaced (ardupilotmega->solo, common->solo_common); message and enum definitions are unchanged. Modern standard dialects remain separate. Regenerate Python and C using the pinned pymavlink release in the owning recipe.
Schema normalization adds missing message descriptions required by the modern XSD. The additive MAV_MISSION_TYPE enum (0,1,2,255) comes from the pinned current common.xml for modern waypoint helpers. Every prior message/field and existing enum value remains unchanged; this does not advertise fence/rally support on legacy firmware.
